#DESCRIPTION
Free-stream (uniform-equilibrium) regression test of the FULL PIC
electromagnetic field solver using the ORIGINAL SEMI-IMPLICIT GMRES solver:
solveEM=T, useHybridPIC=F, solveFieldInCoMov=F, useUpwindE=F, useUpwindB=F.

The initial condition is a uniform plasma with two kinetic species (ions and
electrons, m_e = 0.04 m_i), uniform bulk flow ux = 100 km/s (Mach 1, Alfven speed),
a 3D oblique magnetic field (Bx, By, Bz), plasma beta ~ 1 (T = 314000 K), and the
corresponding convective electric field E = -u x B.

The electric field equation is solved via the standard semi-implicit GMRES scheme
with Crank-Nicolson time discretization (theta = 0.5) without comoving frame
transformation or artificial viscosity.

#INITFROMSWMF
F                       initFromSWMF

#GEOMETRY
-3.2                    xMin  [code units; Lx = 6.4 d_i]
 3.2                    xMax
-0.05                   yMin
 0.05                   yMax
-0.05                   zMin
 0.05                   zMax

#NCELL
32                      nCellX
1                       nCellY
1                       nCellZ

#MAXBLOCKSIZE
64                      maxBlockSizeX
1                       maxBlockSizeY
1                       maxBlockSizeZ

#PERIODICITY
T                       isPeriodicX
T                       isPeriodicY
T                       isPeriodicZ

Full PIC electromagnetic field solver ON
#SOLVEEM
T                       solveEM

#HYBRIDPIC
F                       useHybridPIC

#DIVE
F                       doCorrectDivE
3                       nDivECorrection

#EFIELDSOLVER
1.0e-8                  tol        GMRES relative tolerance
30                      nIter      GMRES max iterations

Field time-discretization for the implicit Maxwell solver (theta-scheme).
theta = 1 is fully implicit, 0.5 is Crank-Nicolson. coefDiff is the
diffusion coefficient (0 = none).
#DISCRETIZATION
0.5                     theta
0.0                     coefDiff

#COMOVING
F                       solveFieldInCoMov
0                       nSmoothBackGroundU

#UPWINDE
F                       useUpwindE
0                       limiterTheta

#UPWINDB
F                       doSmoothB
0                       theta

#SMOOTHJ
F
0
0.0

Two kinetic species: ions (q = 1, m = 1) and electrons (q = -1, m = 0.04).
#PLASMA
2                       nS
1.0                     mass           Species 0: ions
1.0                     charge
0.04                    mass           Species 1: electrons (m_e = 0.04 m_i)
-1.0                    charge

#UNIFORMSTATE
5.0                     rho [amu/cc]   Species 0: ions (n_i = 5 /cc)
100.0                   ux [km/s]      fast bulk flow (u_code = 1.0 = v_A, Mach 1)
0.0                     uy [km/s]
0.0                     uz [km/s]
314000.0                T [K]          ion temperature, beta_i ~ 0.5 (beta_total ~ 1.0)
0.2                     rho [amu/cc]   Species 1: electrons (rho_e = rho_i * m_e / m_i => n_e = 5 /cc, neutral)
100.0                   ux [km/s]      electrons drift with ions (current-free equilibrium)
0.0                     uy [km/s]
0.0                     uz [km/s]
314000.0                T [K]          electron temperature, beta_e ~ 0.5
8.0e-9                  bx [T]         3D oblique magnetic field: Bx0 = 8 nT
6.0e-9                  by [T]         By0 = 6 nT
3.0e-9                  bz [T]         Bz0 = 3 nT (|B| = 10.44 nT)
0.0                     ex [V/m]       convective field E = -u x B: Ex = 0
3.0e-4                  ey [V/m]       Ey = -ux * (-Bz) = +3.0e-4 V/m
-6.0e-4                 ez [V/m]       Ez = -ux * By    = -6.0e-4 V/m

#TIMESTEPPING
T                       useFixedDt
0.02                    dt

#NORMALIZATION
1.0e5                   lNormSI   [m]  ~ d_i so d_i ~ 1 in code units
1.0e5                   uNormSI   [m/s] tNorm = 1 s; sets cLight_SI = uNormSI

#MONITOR
50                      dnReport

#SAVELOG
1                       dnSavePic
1                       dnSavePT

#PARTICLES
2000                    npcelx
1                       npcely
1                       npcelz

#SAVEPLOT
1                       nPlot
z=0 fluid ascii pic     plotString
-1                      dn
10.0                    dt
1                       dx
Bx By Bz Ex Ey Ez RhoS0 UXS0 UYS0 UZS0 pS0 RhoS1 UXS1 UYS1 UZS1 pS1   varName

#STOP
-1                      MaxIter
10.0                    TimeMax   crosses periodic box 1.56 times

#RUN
